{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓團BLACK PINK成員Lisa近日忙於演出美國拉斯維加斯的駐場騷《VIVA LA LISA》，其中一場演出中，身旁舞蹈員為Lisa脫下裙身時，差點連其入面的貼身熱褲也扯下，險走光的Lisa卻處變不驚，絲毫未受影響，繼續淡定表演，獲粉絲激讚專業。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T02:26:41.290868+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T01:56:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T02:20:05.763076+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T02:20:05.763076+00:00","content_hash":"c9a5c7cbd3b0f285b764f8d7cb4d562f42eb0e2a1f44dba0ebcd47cdec234dd9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}